        "text": "He claps his palms together and raises them above his head, body straight like a pencil, then arcs through the air like a golden arrow. The charge becomes a golden meteor bright enough that Gu Masters on the field tear up even with their eyes closed, and it pierces the turtleback myriad wolf king’s shell through from left to right. After the hit his expression pales as he hovers in the air.",
